Building Komport (Qt6)
=======================

Requirements
------------
- CMake >= 3.16
- A C++17 compiler
- Qt 6.2 or newer, with the Widgets, PrintSupport and SerialPort modules
  (on Debian/Ubuntu: qt6-base-dev qt6-serialport-dev)

Build
-----
    cmake -B build -S .
    cmake --build build -j$(nproc)

The resulting binary is build/komport.

Install (optional)
-------------------
    cmake --install build --prefix /usr/local

This installs the binary, the .desktop file and the application icon.
